ion  to devin he tells her that they need to  get inspectors to go and check out  what's happening on the severed floor  she mentions that his audi has been  trying to figure out what they do at  work and he responds that he just wants  to know why he went through with the  procedure and that leads to her  explaining that he lost his wife she  explains how he tried to go back to his  job as a professor but he wasn't able to  because she was still in his veins you  know making everything hurt just after  we see harmony pass herb going the other  way she finally gets milcheck on the  phone she tells him that the otc has  been activated and that she just saw  mark as his innie at the party she  believes that dylan is behind it and  that they were planning this all along  she tells him to get to the security  office and stop dylan he takes off  sprinting down the hall but he can't get  inside the office when he gets there  because of dylan's belt devin tells mark  that she thinks they need to be careful  about who they talk to because lumen has  their hands in so many pies she thinks  the right idea might be to contact  journalists that rickon knows while  they're talking about that he remembers  to ask her why cobell was there he  explains that that's his boss and devin  realizes that it's who she knows as mrs  selvig this freaks her out because she  knows she gave her baby to her and now  they can't find her the whole party  starts to look for her and at this point  everything is starting to come together  helly's getting ready to go on stage irv  has pulled up outside bert's house and  milcheck continues to cut through his  belt while he tries to talk dylan down  offering him new perks ones that he says  he's never even heard about like  paintball and coffee cozies and dylan  just says he wants to remember his son  being born at this milchek tells him he  has two others and promises to tell him  their names if he just opens the door  harmony does arrive at the gala s