ldn't know about certainly  makes you wonder he seems to be working  towards integrating the indian audi by  passing that information telling him to  go looking for this elevator the whole  romance with bert was one of the most  fun things to watch because of the  situation they find themselves in and it  made for a sad reveal at the end but i'm  still thinking there's more to come from  these two i'm just not sure how the way  things were left his audi is going to be  at the door when bert opens it and  perhaps since his name was on the map  they'll already know each other maybe  he's already reached out to some of  these severed employees mark just has to  go looking for gemma what's going on  with her and that testing floor is a  central mystery in conjunction with the  story of him finding himself being the  central character it all makes marx seem  special not just a harmony but possibly  to the egan's overall goal and that is  an even bigger question i suppose we're  closer to understanding and that we know  that they want to make everyone kiers  children but what exactly does that mean  waffle parties for everyone get people  to get the chip not just for work but in  the way that gabby's using it and then  flip the switch activate the cure army i  mean i guess we're gonna have to wait  and see i'll take some time and think  about it all and then i'll put out a  couple more videos i know i said i'd do  that last week but i got covered and i  still haven't really recovered yet but  there is more severance content to come  i think this is a good place to leave  this one i can't wait to hear what you  guys thought about the finale how your  ideas about the show have changed what  your theories are going into season two  so make sure you let me know all about  them in the comments please like this  video if you enjoyed it please subscribe  to my channel if you haven't already and  thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon

